      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "# Tabular Classification: Production\n\nThe one-box classification pipeline: a labelled dataset goes in, a trained classifier, its held-out **accuracy**, class-index **predictions** and a rendered **confusion matrix** come out. The trainer does the whole production dance — stratified train/validation split, feature standardisation folded into the model, mini-batch Adam with early stopping and rollback — and streams a live loss curve under itself while it runs.\n\n### Your own data\n\nThe in-graph generator exists so the template runs out of the box: delete it, wire **Read CSV / Read XLSX / Read DB → DATASET** into the trainer's `dataset` slot (connect its `X` / `y` too), and the rest of the graph is unchanged. Class indices must be `0..k-1`."
      ]
    },
