      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## What to look at\n\n- The trainer's held-out **accuracy** and the confusion-matrix **accuracy** must agree (both are computed on the same predictions).\n- The matrix diagonal = per-class correct counts; off-diagonal cells are the confusions. Switch the renderer's `normalize` on to get per-class recall percentages.\n- Early stopping tracks the smoothed validation **loss** (`early_stop_metric` widget); flip it to `accuracy` if you prefer the metric view.\n- Interrupt a long run and hit **Resume** in the Crash Site panel — training continues from the breakpoint step."
      ]
    }
